sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as React client
    participant Edge as CloudFront (stated)
    participant ALB as ALB (stated)
    participant GW as Gateway
    participant Redis as Redis
    participant Svc as Backend service
    participant LLM as LLM / external API
    participant DB as MongoDB
    UI->>Edge: API request with credentials
    Edge->>ALB: Forward (origin protocol unverified)
    ALB->>GW: Route to Gateway target
    GW->>Redis: Validate session for protected path
    Redis-->>GW: Session/user data
    GW->>Svc: Proxy request + x-user-id
    opt AI-enabled operation
        Svc->>LLM: Synchronous model invocation
        LLM-->>Svc: Generated output
    end
    Svc->>DB: Read/write durable record
    DB-->>Svc: Result
    Svc-->>GW: HTTP response
    GW-->>ALB: Response
    ALB-->>Edge: Origin response
    Edge-->>UI: Response
